o  the late paul walker diesel continued i  told you years ago that i was going to  fulfill my promise to pablo i swore that  we would reach and manifest the best  fast in the finale that is 10. i say  this out of love but you must show up  ops can't be played by no other i hope  that you rise to the occasion and  fulfill your destiny so it looks like  diesel is happy to let bygones be  bygones for the sake of the fast  franchise but will johnson feel the same  way well right now johnson has yet to  respond to his former co-star's plea for  reconciliation but considering how  active he is on social media you can  probably expect to hear something soon  it's worth noting that even before his  new instagram post diesel appeared to be  over their feud in a june interview with  men's health the actor claimed his  issues with johnson came from pushing  his co-star to the limit to get the best  performance he said that took a lot of  work we had to get there and sometimes  at that time i could give a lot of tough  love not fellaini asked but i would do  anything i'd have to do in order to get  performances in anything i'm producing  nevertheless it's probably going to take  a lot more than an instagram plea to get  dwayne johnson signed on to fast 10 and  11 and there's no way to know if vin  diesel has reached out to johnson in  private or whether the social media  strategy is currently his only plan of  action unsurprisingly if the fast and  the furious fandom had anything to say  about it johnson would have signed on  the dotted line right away diesel's  instagram post was liked well over a  half a million times and had ten  thousand comments just a mere two hours  after it was posted in the past fans  seem to have taken johnson's side in the  feud but for the sake of fast 10 it  looks like everyone is on the side of  family check out one of our newest  videos right here plus even more looper  videos about your favorite movies and tv  shows are coming soon subscribe to our  youtube channel and hit the bell so you  don't miss a single one  [Music]

